      "label": "3V3",
      "x": 16,
      "y": 132,
      "type": "power",
      "voltage": {
        "min": 3.0,
        "max": 3.6
      },
      "description": "3.3 V supply (the module's regulators make the sensor's 2.8 V and 1.2 V). Not 5 V."
    },
    {
